# Every published contract must be byte-identical wherever it is fetched from: the
# certificate JWS profile, the CT-log segment format and the cov-v1 module are all
# hash-compared across repos (FS-10 FS10-020 mirrors this repo's coverage/ into the
# deployed Worker bundle and fails on a hash difference). CRLF injection on a Windows
# checkout would break that comparison silently, so text normalisation is forced.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
